## Additional, answer-dependent lists

Each age was also submitted to `result` with `extended:false` using all-zero and all-one numeric answers to the initial questions. All-zero completed at every age: `below_floor` at 48 ages, but unexpectedly `on_pace` / `devAge:1` at age 1 (identical on a repeat request). All-one returned the following extension lists at ages 0–41; ages 42–48 completed without extension. These are observed profiles, not an exhaustive enumeration of all answer combinations.

